  "description": "Intern Se-Hui enters a hotel guest house to find a cat under temporary protection. As luck would have it, this is where Hana Group's Executive Director Lee Jae-Hyun is staying. Startled by footsteps, she hides in the bathroom!? Sensual breathing sounds accompany the roar of water, and hazy steam fills the bathroom. Swoosh! The shower curtain opened, and Se-Hui met Jae-Hyun's icy gaze!\n\n*“Don't show your face in front of me until your last day of work.”*\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
